    [44917,45062,"Jenkins","Carys","Carys is a friendly and enthusiastic member of the Year 10 group. Within our school community Carys’ attendance at the Swimming, Athletics and Cross Country Carnivals has enriched those events and demonstrates the valuable contributions she can make and her capacity to support the collaborative team culture of Kogara House. Carys is a formidable sportsperson and has participated in the Open Futsal Competition, the NASSA Football trials, the Under 16 Futsal Competition, CIS Cup Soccer Competition as well as the NASSA Cross Country. Her strength and determination have also been displayed as a participant of the Duke of Edinburgh Award and her participation in various outdoor education hikes. These activities have supplemented her role as an Outdoor Education Leader where she takes the opportunity to Mentor and guide younger students through her actions. I have been impressed by Carys’ growth and maturity this semester. Carys has recently been awarded a Dean’s Award in recognition of her efforts. "],
